{"name":"Sea Garden","hex":"#568e88","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"sea garden","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An aquaculture field, an artificial flat intertidal zone full of sand and shell debris, used to raise shellfish, such as beach clams and beach crabs."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/sea_garden"}],"entries":[{"title":"Sea Garden (Burgas)","blocks":[{"text":"The Sea Garden is the Bulgarian port city of Burgas' largest and best known public park. It is located along the city's coast on the Black Sea and it is an important tourist attraction and a national monument of landscape architecture on the Balkans."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/AleqBs1.jpg/330px-AleqBs1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sea_Garden_(Burgas)"},{"title":"Sea Garden (Varna)","blocks":[{"text":"The Sea Garden, or formally the Seaside Park is the Bulgarian port city of Varna's largest, oldest and best known public park, also said to be the largest landscaped park in the Balkans. Located along the city's coast on the Black Sea, it is an important tourist attraction and a national monument of landscape architecture."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2f/Varna_Bulgaria_garden.jpg/330px-Varna_Bulgaria_garden.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sea_Garden_(Varna)"},{"title":"Sea","blocks":[{"text":"A sea is a very large body of salty water. The term has two distinct meanings. The first is the interconnected body of seawater that spans most of Earth, known as the sea or the ocean. The second is a named body of water: usually either a marginal sea, or a large, nearly landlocked body of water."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1c/Mediterranean_Sea_16.61811E_38.99124N.jpg/330px-Mediterranean_Sea_16.61811E_38.99124N.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sea"},{"title":"Garden","blocks":[{"text":"A garden is a planned space, usually outdoors, set aside for the cultivation, display, and enjoyment of plants and other forms of nature. The single feature identifying even the wildest wild garden is control. The garden can incorporate both natural and artificial materials."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/41/Brooklyn_Botanic_Garden_New_York_May_2015_010.jpg/330px-Brooklyn_Botanic_Garden_New_York_May_2015_010.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Garden"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/eb/%D0%9C%D0%BE%D1%80%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%B0.jpg/500px-%D0%9C%D0%BE%D1%80%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%B0.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/eb/%D0%9C%D0%BE%D1%80%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%B0.jpg/500px-%D0%9C%D0%BE%D1%80%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%B0.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"In a peaceful recess in the Sea Garden","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A%D0%9C%D0%BE%D1%80%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%B0.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ae/Kazino8.jpg/500px-Kazino8.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ae/Kazino8.jpg/1280px-Kazino8.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ae/Kazino8.jpg/500px-Kazino8.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The Morsko Kazino (Marine Casino) in the Sea Garden of Burgas","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/